{"unit_id":"LiangHeOvO__dsh-zh-cn#card-zh","repo":"LiangHeOvO/dsh-zh-cn","commit":"57c34ff72d62e79ac94d7c0259073d9617cd1183","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"全局中文模式是一个 DSH Host 插件，通过 systemPrompt.section 和 systemPrompt.context 把简体中文语言设定加入系统提示词及运行时上下文。它注册提示词开头的完整规则、提示词末尾的短规则和每步上下文快照，让模型在思考与面向用户的回复中使用简体中文，同时保留代码、命令、路径和专有名词原文。用户可调整主段顺序、替换或补充文本，并单独关闭收尾段、快照或整个插件；适合希望 DSH 会话默认使用简体中文的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-111","index.js:120-171"]}
{"unit_id":"LiangHeOvO__dsh-zh-cn#card-en","repo":"LiangHeOvO/dsh-zh-cn","commit":"57c34ff72d62e79ac94d7c0259073d9617cd1183","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Always Chinese adds Simplified Chinese guidance to DSH system prompts and runtime context. It registers a full opening rule, a short ending rule, and a per-turn snapshot while preserving code and proper names. Users can customize the main text and order or disable the ending rule and snapshot.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-111","index.js:120-171"]}
